@startuml
title G1 的两道写屏障（以 x.f = y 为例）
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam roundcorner 6
rectangle "① pre-write barrier（SATB 屏障）\n若并发标记进行中且旧值非空：\n把旧值 x.f 压入线程 SATB 缓冲" as Pre #LightCoral
rectangle "② 真正的赋值\nx.f = y" as Asg #LightYellow
rectangle "③ post-write barrier（记忆集屏障）\n算出 y 所在卡：\n若卡未脏则标脏并加入 refinement 队列" as Post #LightBlue
rectangle "并发标记正确性\n保住「标记开始时的快照」" as G1 #WhiteSmoke
rectangle "跨 region 引用完整性\n记住「谁指向收集区」" as G2 #WhiteSmoke
Pre --> Asg
Asg --> Post
Pre -[hidden]right-> G1
Post -[hidden]right-> G2
G1 -[hidden]down-> G2
note bottom of Pre
  顺序关键：先记录旧值，再执行写入；
  否则旧值可能被覆盖丢失 → 漏标。
end note
note bottom of Post
  只需标记「目的地卡」；即使并发下重复标脏也无害
  （refinement 幂等，最坏多扫一张卡）。
end note
@enduml
